        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "பூமாலை",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s028-d009",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 33,
            "printedPage": 25
          }
        ],
        "text": "Yes, dear!",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s028-u011",
        "kind": "stage-direction",
        "speakerLabel": null,
        "sourceRecordId": null,
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 33,
            "printedPage": 25
          }
        ],
        "text": "(Poomalai arrives just then.)",
        "notes": [
          "Unit ID preserved while its array position is restored to the source order after the two preceding calls."
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s028-u014",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "குமுதா",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s028-d010",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 33,
            "printedPage": 25
          }
        ],
        "text": "We've taken photos separately. The two of us will stand together—you take one!",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s028-u015",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "பூமாலை",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s028-d011",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 33,
            "printedPage": 25
          }
        ],
        "text": "Uh-uh, Kumudha! I don't know how to take one. You take it yourself!",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s028-u016",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "குமுதா",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s028-d012",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 33,
            "printedPage": 25
          }
        ],
        "text": "Oh, Chinnamma! (Taking the camera with a pout) All right, Chinnamma! You two stand together; I'll take it. (Without guile.)",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s028-u017",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "பூமாலை",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s028-d013",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 33,
            "printedPage": 25
          }
        ],
        "text": "Me?",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s028-u018",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "குமுதா",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s028-d014",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 33,
            "printedPage": 25
          }
        ],
        "text": "Go and stand there, Chinnamma!",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
