            "pdfPage": 34,
            "printedPage": 26
          }
        ],
        "text": "(They embrace.)",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s028-u027",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "பாண்டியன்",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s028-d020",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 34,
            "printedPage": 26
          }
        ],
        "text": "Kumudha, congratulations....",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s028-u028",
        "kind": "stage-direction",
        "speakerLabel": null,
        "sourceRecordId": null,
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 34,
            "printedPage": 26
          }
        ],
        "text": "(The two try to shake hands.)",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s028-u029",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "குண்டுமணி",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s028-d021",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 34,
            "printedPage": 26
          }
        ],
        "text": "(Showing the newspaper) Look at this number: sixteen twenty-four....",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s028-u030",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "பாண்டியன்",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s028-d022",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 34,
            "printedPage": 26
          }
        ],
        "text": "Twenty-four.... Why, my age is twenty-four too.",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s028-u031",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "குமுதா",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s028-d023",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 34,
            "printedPage": 26
          }
        ],
        "text": "My age is only sixteen.",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s028-u032",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "குண்டுமணி",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s028-d024",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 34,
            "printedPage": 26
          }
        ],
        "text": "A well-matched number indeed.",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s028-u033",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "பூமாலை",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s028-d025",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 34,
            "printedPage": 26
          }
        ],
        "text": "(Sharply) Hey....keep quiet....",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s028-u034",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "குண்டுமணி",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s028-d026",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 34,
            "printedPage": 26
          }
        ],
        "text": "No, ma'am. I mean Kumudha-amma should always remain sixteen years old, like Markandi.",
        "notes": [
          "The printed proper-name form `மார்க்கண்டி` is transliterated as Markandi rather than silently normalized to a different form."
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s028-u035",
        "kind": "stage-direction",
        "speakerLabel": null,
        "sourceRecordId": null,
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 34,
            "printedPage": 26
          }
        ],
        "text": "(Everyone laughs.)",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s028-u036",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "பூமாலை",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s028-d027",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 34,
            "printedPage": 26
          }
        ],
        "text": "Then shall we leave for our town?",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s028-u037",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "குமுதா",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s028-d028",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 34,
            "printedPage": 26
          }
        ],
        "text": "He....",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s028-u038",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "குண்டுமணி",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s028-d029",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 34,
            "printedPage": 26
          }
        ],
        "text": "You don't have to worry about him, amma. From now on, even if we chase him away, he won't leave us!",
        "notes": []
      }
    ]
  }
}
